# The image is a standard multi-stage build from this repository checkout
# (see Dockerfile). The context is an explicit allowlist: exactly the files
# the Dockerfile build stage consumes. No git history, no .env files, no
# local .data directory, no test output and no deploy state can ever enter
# an image context, even by accident.
**
